{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Mother: Survivor is a fast paced action shooter with roguelite elements. Conquer a relentless horde of horrific fever dream creatures. Theorycraft with player passives and navigate randomly generated items whilst battling your way to become an unstoppable force. Survive long enough to face the true evil, Void Mother herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/89e32e8cc964fb54a32d3540c34557f8.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>TL;DR</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fever dream Single-player experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike elements with randomly generated player passives.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action packed fun with theorycrafting items and distinct enemy types.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta progress with different characters and enhancements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/567a59687619037aa6284ce7955d0137.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/c74ab975986b12e0d1986c72c46c617b.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THEORYCRAFT TO RELEASE YOUR TRUE POTENTIAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theorycraft randomly generated layer passives. With amassed skill and some luck on your side, you will become the unstoppable force, breaking down the seemingly immovable object.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/6cb2c5cccfb3d04681f5edc40349cc73.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/407773144bf5d15ca818d21e3871673d.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLE DISTINCTIVE ENEMY TYPES TO SINK YOUR FURY INTO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy is distinct and will challenge you in different ways. You are always equipped to deal with the slow and weak. But don't slack off or they will grow too strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/52313d886f4ba75af3702a52303520f8.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/6af3728220e52f6d9b3da0a4bd8a5850.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FAST PACED THRILLRIDE AND YOU\u2019RE THE DRIVER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind, in front, to your left or right. They are everywhere, a never ending feast. You need to stay alert and keep up without fail and do so by sending a message. Make them suffer, reap the reward, and show them what true pain feels like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/84947392ba10e48cb612fe5902d71e40.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/1b1f07197b1ee9cc3cfdc33f7359e690.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=344 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >META PROGRESSION, COLLECT KEYCARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build yourself up, purchase new characters, whatever tickles your fancy. There is progress to be made outside each run with different kinds of Masks and Enhancements. That will continuously alter the way you play and interact with the enemy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2913310?t=1730192494","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1730192494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730192494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730192494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Void Mother features violence and may not be suitable for all ages."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3024630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Mother: Survivor is a fast paced action shooter with roguelite elements. Conquer a relentless horde of horrific fever dream creatures. Theorycraft with player passives and navigate randomly generated items whilst battling your way to become an unstoppable force. Survive long enough to face the true evil, Void Mother herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913310/extras/89e32e8cc964fb54a32d3540c34557f8.avif?t=1730192494\" width=616 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>TL;DR</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_para